{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 72,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9458618164062,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent testing needs to be framed as a more efficient way of working (i.e. testing two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9478759765625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "samples concurrently during the same visit, instead of testing one sample during each of two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        527.0030517578125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "separate visits) that also allows increasing access and reducing costs for patients. According",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9654541015625,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "to a laboratory manager, this framing of the benefits outweighing the additional workload,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9369506835938,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "and potentially resulting in reduced work in the long run, will be critical to avoid concurrent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.9589233398438,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "testing being perceived as additional work for already overburdened health care workers (see",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        163.98040771484375,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        526.9959716796875,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "Prior investments made in frontrunner technologies, donor preferences, limited health systems",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972515106201172,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        526.9479370117188,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "thinking and unnecessary competition between manufacturers all pose challenges to policy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        527.1150512695312,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "adoption and implementation of novel molecular diagnostics. In addition, national in-country",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998700141906738,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.66522216796875,
        526.6863403320312,
        245.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "health technology and cost-efficacy assessments can delay decisions to implement newer",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.16522216796875,
        493.9747009277344,
        261.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "technologies and diagnostic strategies using different samples (see  ). Web Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.6767272949219,
        275.1541442871094,
        290.05670166015625
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.3076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        313.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        300.3076171875,
        526.9201049804688,
        313.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "Global and national HIV and TB programmes need to communicate regularly and clearly,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        315.8076171875,
        448.9673156738281,
        328.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "indicating responsibilities for concurrent testing for people living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.3076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        344.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        331.3076171875,
        526.89697265625,
        344.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent testing maximizes diagnostic opportunity and accuracy of case detection, is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        346.8076171875,
        526.96533203125,
        359.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "a more efficient way to address the needs of this population and is preferred even if the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        362.3076171875,
        237.1345977783203,
        375.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "testing workload may increase.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.8076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        390.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        377.8076171875,
        407.83990478515625,
        390.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "A positive result on either test is sufficient to confirm TB diagnosis.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.3076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        406.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        393.3076171875,
        526.6121826171875,
        406.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "Patient loss to follow-up for the second test result should be monitored and prevented.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        408.8076171875,
        526.9556274414062,
        421.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "Patients should be provided with information to understand the concurrent testing approach",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        424.3076171875,
        220.2732696533203,
        437.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "and the need for follow-up.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.8076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        452.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        439.8076171875,
        526.692626953125,
        452.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "The LF-LAM performed in point-of-care settings may be the first positive result and is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        455.3076171875,
        524.4122314453125,
        468.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "sufficient to make the initial diagnosis. A respiratory sample is still required for rifampicin-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        470.8076171875,
        460.5073547363281,
        483.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "resistance detection, and is also required when the LF-LAM result is negative.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.3076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        499.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        486.3076171875,
        526.9642944335938,
        499.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "Where LF-LAM is not available for testing of people living with HIV, efforts should be made",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        501.8076171875,
        216.74050903320312,
        514.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "to ensure access to testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.3076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        530.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        517.3076171875,
        526.9490356445312,
        530.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "LF-LAM does not differentiate   from other mycobacterial species. However, the LAM  Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        532.8076171875,
        524.4094848632812,
        545.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "antigen detected in a clinical sample in TB endemic areas is most likely attributable to . Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.3076171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        561.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        548.3076171875,
        526.935791015625,
        561.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "When LF-LAM results are consistently positive, without positive LC-aNAAT results,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        563.8076171875,
        527.1624145507812,
        576.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "investigation of the quality of testing and local epidemiology of non-tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        579.3077392578125,
        526.9200439453125,
        592.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "mycobacteria and extrapulmonary TB in the tested population is warranted to understand",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        594.8077392578125,
        156.13189697265625,
        607.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "the difference.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.3077392578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        623.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        610.3077392578125,
        526.9642333984375,
        623.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "Interpreting bands on the LF-LAM test strip should be performed using the manufacturer’s",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        625.8077392578125,
        290.7251892089844,
        638.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "reading card to minimize incorrect results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.3077392578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        654.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        641.3077392578125,
        526.5689697265625,
        654.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "LF-LAM test strips must be stored according to the manufacturer’s instructions (e.g. between",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956313133239746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        656.8077392578125,
        365.3489990234375,
        669.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "2 and 30 °C) in sealed bags and not used after expiration.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.3077392578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        685.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        672.3077392578125,
        526.9581909179688,
        685.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "Infrastructure to collect a urine sample privately should be available. Patients should be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        687.8077392578125,
        526.9973754882812,
        700.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "instructed how to properly and sanitarily collect a urine sample to minimize contamination",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        703.3077392578125,
        247.4739990234375,
        716.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "and prevent false positive results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.8077392578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        731.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        718.8077392578125,
        459.7257995605469,
        731.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "Trained staff will be required to perform the LF-LAM test at the point of care.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        734.3077392578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        747.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        734.3077392578125,
        526.96435546875,
        747.4527587890625
      ],
      "text": "As with all WHO-recommended TB diagnostics, quality assurance programmes and quality",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        749.8077392578125,
        258.20989990234375,
        762.9527587890625
      ],
      "text": "controls for both tests are required.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "56 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}